{"ticker":{"symbol":"008870.KS","name":"금비","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":36300.0,"change_pct":-0.03585657370517925,"market_cap":36300001280.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.03581267217630854,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":62000.0,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","country":"South Korea","city":"Icheon-si","employees":230,"website":"https://www.kumbi.co.kr","business_summary":"Kumbi Corporation engages in glass product manufacturing and cosmetics trading. The company offers glass bottles for liquor, beverage, pharmaceutical, and cosmetics industries; bottle caps that include non-metallic plastics caps and metal caps for domestic beverage companies and worldwide; and plastic containers, such as cosmetics containers. It also engages in cosmetics wholesale and retail and cosmetic container injection molding and coating assembly. The company was formerly known as Jin Ro Glass Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Kumbi Corporation in February 1983. Kumbi Corporation was incorporated in 1973 and is headquartered in Icheon-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"금비코퍼레이션은 유리제품 제조 및 화장품 무역업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 주류, 음료, 제약 및 화장품 산업에 유리병을 제공합니다. 국내 음료회사 및 전세계적으로 비금속 플라스틱 캡과 금속 캡을 포함하는 병뚜껑; 화장품 용기 등의 플라스틱 용기 등을 들 수 있다. 또한 화장품 도소매업, 화장품 용기 사출성형 및 코팅조립 사업도 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 진로유리주식회사로 알려졌으나 1983년 2월에 금비주식회사로 사명을 변경했습니다. 금비주식회사는 1973년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 이천시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"포장","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":234952392830.0,"operating_income":-6480940.0,"net_income":-13225542720.0,"eps":-16338.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":250958272030.0,"operating_income":5890126330.0,"net_income":-6780751560.0,"eps":-8299.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":259456804260.0,"operating_income":12361950000.0,"net_income":3587900390.0,"eps":4384.0},